---

<aside class="home-specimen" role="note" data-nucleus-specimen>
  <p>
    <strong>3D Nucleus Prototype: development only, not part of the website.</strong> This is the
    same Three.js model, through the same interface, that the real homepage mounts since P20; here
    it has simulated tabs, a mapping inspector and diagnostics, for scientific and visual inspection.
    It is an illustration of interphase chromatin organisation, not a reconstruction of a cell, a
    measured genome or a simulation. A production build leaves this page out.
  </p>
